{"script":"yd_015_04","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1a","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":-120,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-474,"img":"chara015_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1a","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":-120,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-474,"img":"chara015_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]树冠守望者，就是黑森林里“护林人”这一派的首领，目前也暂时由我统领黑森林的住民们。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]很多人都认为我身居高位，非常辛苦，但他们错了，真正辛苦的是我们中每一位千锤百炼、呕心沥血的护林人战士、布宴者和巨木侍女。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]我们的权力没那么集中，大部分日常事务能由下属部门自行决策。[r]而他们的优秀证明了这套制度的成功，我多数时间也只能作为他们的后盾。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]如今，我甚至有了点空闲时间，能做点自己的事……比如药圃什么的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]总之……你有事找我，也不必担心会耽误我的时间。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1b","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":-120,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-474,"img":"chara015_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"芭杜尔-熟识1"}